{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "eb7385fc038249519aece9fcd961195e", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "把常见售后问题整理成一页培训材料", "id": "6a562691108843db89f9a68fb24f1347", "created_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:37.361421", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "0b79cee13dc84095886d3acd0059a749", "created_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:37.361421"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "根据问题类型判断无需外部工具，直接基于已知信息作答。", "id": "ecd9d6972ac849a794301227d03d9b6e", "created_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:41.759306", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "已整理《售后常见问题速查》：\n1. 封口不严/漏气：优先查加热温度与硅胶压板磨损，备件硅胶压板160。\n2. 膜材跑偏：校膜卷对中与色标传感器。\n3. 切刀切不断：更换横封切刀组件并调间隙至0.02mm。\n4. 计量波动：计量螺杆磨损或物料架桥，加装振动器。\n5. 装盒卡盒：真空吸盘老化，换吸盘并校气压0.55MPa。\n建议附现场照片规范与报修流程图。", "id": "e6ae38fddeef45a5a05cc94c43cb2545", "created_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:41.759306", "finished_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:41.759306"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "1767732738af47b8ae5bd8275fa0dff1", "created_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:41.759306", "finished_at": "2026-08-11T11:09:41.759306"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}, "scroll": {"persisted_ids": [], "persisted_tcids": []}, "mode_state": {}}}